        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BC218, Solid Brass Door Ball Catch</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBall catches are installed in the top, bottom and/or side of the door to hold them closed. An adjustable ball catch, the ball retaining cylinder threads into the catch face plate for 1/2\" of adjustment. Available in 10 different finishes, packaged with matching screws. Used in conjunction with dummy hardware. Supplied with strike and mounting hardware, made of solid brass.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BC218-Specifications.gif?v=1704354636\" width=\"600\" height=\"190\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BC218 Ball Catch Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-ball-catch-with-round-corners-deltana-bc218r\"><b>Ball Catch with Round Corners</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana BC218 Door Ball Catch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Corner Type: Square</li>\r\n<li>Catch Face Plate Length: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Catch Face Plate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Catch Face Plate Depth: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustment Length: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Length: 2-1/8\" </li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BC218.pdf?v=1691095270\"><b>Deltana BC218 Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Ball Catch",
                "description": "Solid Brass Door Ball Catch Deltana BC218 - Ball catches are installed in the top, bottom and/or side of the door to hold them closed. An adjustable ball catch, the ball retaining cylinder threads into the catch face plate for 1/2 inches of adjustment. Available in 10 different finishes, packaged with matching screws. Used in conjunction with dummy hardware. Supplied with strike and mounting hardware, made of solid brass.",
